# Packaged builds. The release workflow produces these and attaches them to a
# GitHub Release; they should never be committed.
*.zip

# Local AI-assistant config. Machine-specific and nobody else's business.
.claude/

# Nothing here reads a .env today. Ignored anyway, so that the first person to try
# keeping a GitHub token in one cannot commit it by accident. The OAuth client id is
# not a secret and lives in src/github/config.ts; a client secret would be, which is
# why the app is registered without one.
.env
.env.*
